<h1>Affiliate disclosure</h1>
<p class="lede"><strong>Today: this site contains no affiliate links, sponsored placements or ads.</strong></p>
<p>In the future some links to stores may become affiliate links. If you buy through one, the site may earn a small commission at no extra cost to you. When that happens:</p>
<ul>
  <li>This page will be updated first, and any page with affiliate links will say so near the top.</li>
  <li>Which models we cover, and what we say about them, will keep coming only from the makers, NFPA, USFA and CPSC — never from what pays.</li>
  <li>Links to sources (the numbered citations) will never be affiliate links.</li>
</ul>
<p>Questions? Open an issue on <a href="{{ site.repo }}/issues">GitHub</a>.</p>
